:"Rep. Beatty, Joyce [D-OH-3]","isOriginalCosponsor":false,"party":"D","sponsorshipDate":"2025-12-10","sponsorshipWithdrawnDate":null,"state":"OH"},{"bioguideId":"M001136","fullName":"Rep. McClain, Lisa C. [R-MI-9]","isOriginalCosponsor":false,"party":"R","sponsorshipDate":"2025-12-17","sponsorshipWithdrawnDate":null,"state":"MI"},{"bioguideId":"C001126","fullName":"Rep. Carey, Mike [R-OH-15]","isOriginalCosponsor":false,"party":"R","sponsorshipDate":"2026-01-27","sponsorshipWithdrawnDate":null,"state":"OH"},{"bioguideId":"P000620","fullName":"Rep. Pettersen, Brittany [D-CO-7]","isOriginalCosponsor":false,"party":"D","sponsorshipDate":"2026-07-30","sponsorshipWithdrawnDate":null,"state":"CO"}],"fetchedAt":"2026-09-16T19:48:46+00:00","id":"hr1357-119","introducedDate":"2025-02-13","latestAction":{"actionDate":"2025-02-13","text":"Referred to the Committee on Education and Workforce, and in addition to the Committee on Ways and Means, for a period to be subsequently determined by the Speaker, in each case for consideration of such provisions as fall within the jurisdiction of the committee concerned."},"laws":[],"number":"1357","originChamber":"House","policyArea":"Labor and Employment","sponsors":[{"bioguideId":"T000463","district":10,"fullName":"Rep. Turner, Michael R. [R-OH-10]","party":"R","state":"OH"}],"summaries":[{"actionDate":"2025-02-13","actionDesc":"Introduced in House","text":"<p><strong>Susan Muffley Act of 202</strong><strong>5</strong></p><p>This bill restores the full vested monthly benefits for eligible participants of certain pension plans that were sponsored by Delphi Corporation and terminated as a result of General Motors' bankruptcy in 2009.</p><p>The Pension Benefit Guaranty Corporation (PBGC) must recalculate and adjust each plan participant's monthly benefits payment. The PBGC must also apply the recalculation to previously-made monthly payments and make a lump-sum payment for any additional benefits based on the recalculation.</p><p>The bill establishes and provides appropriations to a fund for the payment of these benefits and specifies how the lump-sum payments are treated for tax purposes.</p>","updateDate":"2025-09-09T15:39:21Z","versionCode":"00"}],"title":"Susan Muffley Act of 2025","type":"hr","updateDate":"2026-07-31T08:05:40Z","updateDateIncludingText":"2026-07-31T08:05:40Z"}
